{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00734","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享章怀太子庙乐章 登歌酌鬯 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 享章怀太子庙乐章 登歌酌鬯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忠孝本着，羽翼先成。\n寝门昭德，驰道爲程。\n币帛有典，容卫无声。\n司存既肃，庙享惟清。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00734.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00734","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}